          steps = "Go to 66.6, 42.8 in Revendreth and click the Flickering Candle on the wall to slide the rug aside, opening the staircase down to the hidden crypt. Clear the guards and loot the chest against the far wall. It does not spawn every day, and the Soullocked Sinstone is only a small chance from it. Click the candle by the stairs to reopen the way out." },
