          steps = "Collect the Animated Ulna from Maldraxxus pet battle world quests and buy the Animated Radius from Nalcorn Talsen for 250 Polished Pet Charms. Only while carrying both does Skeletal Hand Fragments become visible at 47.4, 62.1 in the Iron Trench; loot it for the Flexing Phalanges, then combine all three." },
