          steps = "Push the Zereth Mortis campaign far enough to reach Firim in Exile's Hollow, then talk to him for Firim's Spare Forge-tap and use it on the Progenitor Forges scattered around the zone to harvest Ephemera Strands. Weave 15 strands into an Ephemera Orb and open it; the orb rolls one of six rewards, so expect to build a good number before it pays out." },
